  "name": "Signal Tuner",
  "url": "shaders/signal-tuner.wgsl",
  "description": "TV-style signal interference around the cursor: rows wobble with an R/B split inside the tuning radius, clicks launch retuning rings, and history ghosts only inside the zone. Upgraded with off-station snow (Static Noise mixes treble-flickered snow where the wobble is strongest), an RF multipath ghost (a delayed-path copy offset right by Frequency), and detune beat bands (slow moire bands where the row wobble nears the raster pitch).",
